title: Sturzo Dismissed!
view-if: year == 1923 and month = 7 and week = 1 and (roman_question_answered = 0 or pope = "Del Val") and ppi_leader == "Sturzo" and pnf_in_government
frequency: 1000
max-visits: 1
on-arrival: ppi_leader = "De Gasperi" if ppi_leader == "Sturzo";
tags: event

Luigi Sturzo, head of the <span style="font-weight: bold; color:#87CEFA;">PPI</span>, has suddenly and shockingly resigned as party leader after a meeting with Pope Pius XI, though our sources indicate that [+ prime_minister +] had negotiated an agreement with the <span style="font-weight: bold; color:#A88D37;">Holy See</span> to do so. Alcide De Gasparri takes his place as party leader.

- @root: Concerning.